  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-timeline\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fbfcf3; box-sizing: border-box; color: #354231; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 22px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 0; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background-color: #edf0df; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 22px 24px; text-align: left; width: 100%\"><h1 style=\"color: inherit; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 550; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #354231; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 12px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; text-align: left; width: 100%\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 28px 0 28px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background-color: #edf0df; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 13px 12px 0; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"color: #354231; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">留一点时间给自己</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 12px 0 12px 18px; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; width: 100%\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\">从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><section style=\"margin: 20px 0 20px auto; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 6px 0 6px; width: 82%\"><blockquote style=\"background-color: #edf0df; color: #354231; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 12px 0; padding: 12px 18px 12px; text-align: left\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote></section></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 28px 0 28px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background-color: #edf0df; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 13px 12px 0; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"color: #354231; font-family: Georgia, &#39;Songti SC&#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">让行动变得简单</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 12px 0 12px 18px; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; width: 100%\"><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 22px\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">留意自己的真实感受</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #5b7542; border: 1px solid #ced6c1; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">时段</th><th style=\"background-color: #5b7542; border: 1px solid #ced6c1; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ced6c1; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">早晨</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ced6c1; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ced6c1; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">傍晚</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ced6c1; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><section style=\"border-top: 1px solid #5b7542; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 12px 0 0\"><p style=\"border-top: 2px solid #5b7542; color: #354231; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 12px 0 0; text-align: left\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section></section></section></section>"
